Z||000032||SCCA FIERO||09-11-1999||03:35 AM||||That is a rebuilt long block with a 2 year/24K mile warranty. I have been quoted $1,350 for a <B>short</B> block. I have checked everywhere and none to be found in the boneyards.<P>My father-in-law is trying to locate one too. I sure would rather spend this money on my Fiero, but that's the way my luck goes.||||reg||9
